---
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center place-items-center gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-row gap-10">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">Sani Landing Pages and Sani Dental Group Homepage</h1>
        <a
          href="https://sanidentalgroup.com/"
          class="hover:scale-115 transition-all"
          target="_blank"
        >
          <img src="src/assets/web.jpg" class="w-14" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="text-left flex flex-col gap-4 md:max-w-5xl">
        <p>
          I have designed multiple landing pages for the company I worked in for a year. These landing pages' purpose is to attract and convert new clients.
        </p>
        <p>
          I will display the landing pages with the best conversion rates below. I was also tasked with redesigning the main website for Sani Dental Group, which is 
          a sub-company for my employer. I would first redesign the website in figma and then pass it off to the front-end developer to build and deploy.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the later half of my year working here, I would build the landing pages myself in a JavaScript framework called Astro.js, then  just pass it off to the developer for deploy as well.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section flex justify-center place-items-center">
    <div
          class="md:grid md:grid-cols-3 flex flex-col md:px-70 justify-center place-items-center gap-8"
        >
          <a
            href="https://l.sanidentalgroup.com/dental-summer-deals-mexico/"
            class="hover:-translate-y-2 hover:scale-103 transition-all"
            ><Card
              image="src/assets/sani1.png"
              title="Dental Summer Deals"
              badgeText="Landing Page"
              description="Dental Summer promotion landing page for Sani Dental Group"
            /></a
          >
          <a
            href="https://l.sanidentalgroup.com/clear-aligners/"
            class="hover:-translate-y-2 hover:scale-103 transition-all"
            ><Card
              image="src/assets/sani2.png"
              title="Clear Aligners"
              badgeText="Landing Page"
              description="Landing page for the clear aligners service at Sani Dental Group"
            /></a
          >
          <a
            href="https://l.sanidentalgroup.com/premium-veneers/"
            class="hover:-translate-y-2 hover:scale-103 transition-all"
            ><Card
              image="src/assets/sani3.png"
              title="Premium Veneers"
              badgeText="Landing Page"
              description="Landing page for the premium veneers service at Sani Dental Group"
            /></a
          >
          </a
          >
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
